{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Ticket closeout. ADP store, ADEVX-133 (aa87-35bb-cd9e-43de) and ADEVX-134 (d1cd-7de0-dc15-40d9) both closed after re-verifying every acceptance criterion. Both needed --force because the completion gate wants a rebar-ticket trailer on the implementing commit, which conflicts with this repo's AGENTS.md convention of a ticket-number prefix with a bulleted body and no trailers. Adding the trailer would also mean rewriting a pushed stack and invalidating the code review attested at 6edfae3. The override reasons carry the commit and PR. ADEVX-135 has no rebar ticket by design under the corrected convention."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933874214274001,"uuid":"18a29d93-9c1d-49ce-988d-2a71dd187e4d"}